Firefox does not always follow the fontconfig settings for emoji. To make
it use Apple Color Emoji as well:

  1. Open about:config in the address bar and accept the warning.
  2. Search for:  font.name-list.emoji
  3. Set its value to:  Apple Color Emoji
  4. Restart Firefox.

The setting is stored in your Firefox profile, so it has to be done once
per user (and again for a new profile). If you reset it, Firefox goes
back to its own default emoji font.
